  "id": "verification/a-hook-updating-a-released-message-again-stops-at-the-cap",
  "title": "The release's ON_EVENT_UPDATED runs on the budget of the work it is made in, one of its own from outside: a hook that updates the released message on every update draws a hook call each, and its eleventh update is refused at the cap of ten",
